00:13:16,040 --> 00:13:19,260
My classmate's mother is the mother of that snack bar.

291
00:13:20,600 --> 00:13:21,960
We met once.

292
00:13:22,500 --> 00:13:24,560
Dad, do you go there often?

293
00:13:24,560 --> 00:13:26,300
Oh, no.

294
00:13:26,360 --> 00:13:26,880
A couple of times.

295
00:13:28,200 --> 00:13:29,960
That's a coincidence.

296
00:13:30,740 --> 00:13:31,320
Right?

297
00:13:37,560 --> 00:13:38,880
What's wrong?

298
00:13:39,760 --> 00:13:40,760
Did something happen?

299
00:13:42,280 --> 00:13:43,300
What is it?

300
00:13:44,120 --> 00:13:45,080
What is it, Dad?

301
00:13:45,100 --> 00:13:45,680
No, no.

302
00:13:48,160 --> 00:13:50,480
Could it be that student?

303
00:13:52,560 --> 00:13:52,840
Lena?

304
00:13:52,840 --> 00:13:54,420
What?

305
00:13:54,600 --> 00:13:55,520
Why do you know her?

306
00:13:56,440 --> 00:13:58,460
I mean, she might be working at a store.

307
00:13:59,560 --> 00:14:01,540
She seems to know a lot.

308
00:14:02,040 --> 00:14:02,460
I don't know.

309
00:14:02,660 --> 00:14:03,380
No, no, no.

310
00:14:03,400 --> 00:14:04,140
Tell me.

311
00:14:04,320 --> 00:14:06,620
I feel like she's drinking alcohol.

312
00:14:08,900 --> 00:14:10,520
I don't know because I haven't checked it.

313
00:14:10,520 --> 00:14:11,400
Maybe.

314
00:14:12,300 --> 00:14:13,200
I'm sure.

315
00:14:16,560 --> 00:14:18,260
I totally forgot.

316
00:14:19,620 --> 00:14:21,320
I saw her at Ginza.

317
00:14:23,620 --> 00:14:24,380
What?

318
00:14:24,380 --> 00:14:27,040
Why did you know about that store?

319
00:14:27,620 --> 00:14:28,680
She's a staff at my dad's company.

320
00:14:29,400 --> 00:14:30,020
His name is Yoshizawa.

321
00:14:31,600 --> 00:14:32,520
He met Lena at Ginza's club.

322
00:14:34,260 --> 00:14:36,220
Then he went to her family's snack shop.

323
00:14:37,400 --> 00:14:38,160
He liked it.

324
00:14:38,160 --> 00:14:39,680
She used to work at Ginza.

325
00:14:40,640 --> 00:14:42,120
I think he quit.

326
00:14:42,520 --> 00:14:43,640
He didn't go there anymore.

327
00:14:44,380 --> 00:14:45,020
By the way,

328
00:14:45,020 --> 00:14:47,140
who is Yoshizawa?

329
00:14:49,140 --> 00:14:54,220
He's a member of the National Assembly.

330
00:14:54,940 --> 00:14:55,580
I see.

331
00:14:56,120 --> 00:14:57,440
She's in high school.

332
00:14:58,800 --> 00:15:00,840
That's so creepy.

333
00:15:01,860 --> 00:15:03,200
That's crazy.

334
00:15:04,620 --> 00:15:05,600
I see.

335
00:15:06,580 --> 00:15:07,600
Hey Rio.

336
00:15:08,940 --> 00:15:10,520
Do you know

337
00:15:10,520 --> 00:15:13,160
that her father quit school because of this?

338
00:15:15,020 --> 00:15:16,120
That's right.

339
00:15:17,240 --> 00:15:18,260
If she finds out,

340
00:15:18,660 --> 00:15:19,760
she'll be in trouble.

341
00:15:21,700 --> 00:15:22,900
I see.

342
00:15:25,660 --> 00:15:26,860
Hey.

343
00:15:27,800 --> 00:15:29,340
What did you talk about with Rio?

344
00:15:31,420 --> 00:15:33,220
Nothing special.

345
00:15:34,140 --> 00:15:35,000
Tell me.

346
00:15:35,540 --> 00:15:37,200
It's okay.

347
00:15:37,420 --> 00:15:38,460
It's nothing.

348
00:15:38,460 --> 00:15:39,540
Okay.

349
00:15:43,160 --> 00:15:44,480
Ms. Sawaiya.

350
00:15:46,260 --> 00:15:47,440
I need to talk to you.

351
00:15:48,160 --> 00:15:49,300
Is it about Shinra?

352
00:15:50,480 --> 00:15:51,400
No.

353
00:15:51,600 --> 00:15:52,440
I have something to tell you.

354
00:15:53,300 --> 00:15:54,420
I don't have anything to tell you.

355
00:15:56,800 --> 00:15:58,180
I'll talk to you if something happens.

356
00:15:59,620 --> 00:16:00,520
I mean it.

357
00:16:01,960 --> 00:16:02,920
So,

358
00:16:04,160 --> 00:16:04,780
don't hold back.

359
00:16:08,460 --> 00:16:09,120
Okay.

360
00:16:12,640 --> 00:16:14,060
See you tomorrow.

361
00:16:15,600 --> 00:16:16,820
I can't hold back.

362
00:16:19,540 --> 00:16:21,380
I really want to get rid of my hair,

363
00:16:21,820 --> 00:16:23,380
but it costs 500,000 yen.

364
00:16:23,500 --> 00:16:24,400
That's a lot.

365
00:16:25,100 --> 00:16:25,980
I know.

366
00:16:25,980 --> 00:16:27,360
When I talked to my parents,

367
00:16:27,720 --> 00:16:28,880
they told me to get rid of my hair

368
00:16:28,880 --> 00:16:29,920
as soon as possible.

369
00:16:31,140 --> 00:16:32,600
You're so yanky.

370
00:16:32,600 --> 00:16:33,860
That's right.

371
00:16:33,860 --> 00:16:35,460
You're a geneticist,

372
00:16:35,560 --> 00:16:36,720
so I can't let you go.

373
00:16:39,680 --> 00:16:40,400
Hey.

374
00:16:40,640 --> 00:16:42,720
If you're here,

375
00:16:42,840 --> 00:16:44,000
why don't you come with me?

376
00:16:45,520 --> 00:16:46,040
Wait a minute.

377
00:16:46,040 --> 00:16:47,940
What's wrong?

378
00:16:48,180 --> 00:16:48,920
Well,

379
00:16:49,460 --> 00:16:52,360
thank you.

380
00:16:52,520 --> 00:16:53,560
It's okay.

381
00:16:54,440 --> 00:16:56,860
We're like theater directors.

382
00:16:58,160 --> 00:16:58,440
I'm sorry.

383
00:16:58,940 --> 00:16:59,500
It's okay.

384
00:16:59,500 --> 00:17:00,480
I have to decide

385
00:17:00,480 --> 00:17:01,220
until next week.

386
00:17:03,680 --> 00:17:04,360
After school,

387
00:17:04,620 --> 00:17:05,500
we'll have a meeting at the cinema.

388
00:17:06,320 --> 00:17:07,300
Is that right?

389
00:17:07,840 --> 00:17:09,680
Will Shohei come?

390
00:17:10,120 --> 00:17:11,480
No, I'm not sure.

391
00:17:11,880 --> 00:17:14,400
What about you, Moeko?

392
00:17:15,940 --> 00:17:18,120
I'm not sure.

393
00:17:18,120 --> 00:17:18,760
But

394
00:17:19,500 --> 00:17:21,500
I want to be in a band.

395
00:17:22,400 --> 00:17:23,220
Right?

396
00:17:23,480 --> 00:17:25,220
We have to get members together.

397
00:17:25,960 --> 00:17:26,780
Right.

398
00:17:26,780 --> 00:17:28,360
I'm going to be a bassist.

399
00:17:29,520 --> 00:17:30,400
Really?

400
00:17:31,260 --> 00:17:33,500
I wonder if I can do it.

401
00:17:34,200 --> 00:17:35,080
Hey.

402
00:17:35,840 --> 00:17:36,500
Hello.

403
00:17:36,860 --> 00:17:38,800
How's your rock life going?

404
00:17:39,520 --> 00:17:41,080
I'm going to be a bassist.

405
00:17:42,340 --> 00:17:45,440
Do you know the word Yoshihashi Rhythm?

408
00:17:46,600 --> 00:17:47,720
Do you know?

409
00:17:48,980 --> 00:17:50,580
No, I don't know.

410
00:17:51,140 --> 00:17:52,860
It's not a word.

411
00:17:52,860 --> 00:17:54,100
It's a saying, right?

413
00:17:55,700 --> 00:17:56,600
Don't say that.

414
00:17:58,120 --> 00:17:59,399
In a band, rhythm instruments

415
00:17:59,600 --> 00:18:01,680
I mean drum and bass

416
00:18:01,680 --> 00:18:02,720
are the most important.

417
00:18:03,020 --> 00:18:04,700
If you underestimate drums and bass,

418
00:18:05,320 --> 00:18:05,980
you'll die.

419
00:18:06,860 --> 00:18:08,780
You can't even talk about rock.

420
00:18:09,040 --> 00:18:10,480
Don't underestimate rock.

421
00:18:14,300 --> 00:18:15,940
I'm going to work.

422
00:18:18,300 --> 00:18:20,460
My ears are tight.

423
00:18:20,740 --> 00:18:21,740
We have to find a drummer.

424
00:18:21,740 --> 00:18:23,200
We have to find a good drummer.

425
00:18:28,480 --> 00:18:29,440
What?

426
00:18:34,000 --> 00:18:35,560
Mr. Nishiwaki.

427
00:18:37,420 --> 00:18:37,820
Miyasako.

428
00:18:39,120 --> 00:18:40,080
I'm sorry.

429
00:18:40,740 --> 00:18:42,600
Mr. Nishiwaki.

430
00:18:43,180 --> 00:18:43,900
What?

431
00:18:44,400 --> 00:18:45,360
What?

432
00:18:46,140 --> 00:18:47,500
Would you like to join a band?

433
00:18:48,840 --> 00:18:49,540
A band?

434
00:18:54,440 --> 00:18:55,600
Good night.

435
00:18:56,300 --> 00:18:57,780
See you later.

436
00:18:57,780 --> 00:18:58,600
Oh, no.

437
00:18:58,840 --> 00:18:59,840
Ms. Sasaoka.

438
00:19:00,280 --> 00:19:01,500
Why are you here?

439
00:19:01,620 --> 00:19:05,420
Tell her I'm coming.

440
00:19:07,240 --> 00:19:09,120
See you later.

441
00:19:09,480 --> 00:19:10,760
I wonder

442
00:19:10,760 --> 00:19:13,140
if Lena is here.

443
00:19:14,260 --> 00:19:15,740
She's not here.

444
00:19:16,380 --> 00:19:17,620
She's a high school student, you know!

445
00:19:17,680 --> 00:19:18,760
I know.

446
00:19:18,760 --> 00:19:20,020
I'm so busy.

447
00:19:20,280 --> 00:19:20,620
Sorry.

448
00:19:21,120 --> 00:19:22,140
See you later.

449
00:19:26,380 --> 00:19:30,180
It's not the time to worry about others.

450
00:19:32,760 --> 00:19:34,860
But teachers worry about students.

451
00:19:36,560 --> 00:19:37,940
However, I am not a qualified teacher.

452
00:19:47,620 --> 00:19:49,280
I'm home.

453
00:19:49,900 --> 00:19:50,440
I'm home.

454
00:19:50,440 --> 00:19:51,000
Welcome home.

455
00:19:55,760 --> 00:19:56,980
What's wrong? Are you tired?

457
00:19:59,040 --> 00:20:01,580
Yes, because of that old woman.

458
00:20:02,080 --> 00:20:05,440
I'm going to work when I finish high school.

460
00:20:05,800 --> 00:20:07,280
No, no.

461
00:20:07,080 --> 00:20:07,940
You have to go to high school.

462
00:20:08,560 --> 00:20:10,000
If I go to high school,

463
00:20:10,840 --> 00:20:12,160
it's meaningless.

464
00:20:12,160 --> 00:20:13,880
You don't study.

465
00:20:15,100 --> 00:20:16,980
I'm studying.

466
00:20:18,020 --> 00:20:19,120
But when I graduate,

467
00:20:19,420 --> 00:20:20,260
I'll go to high school.

468
00:20:21,160 --> 00:20:23,100
It's meaningless to go to high school.

469
00:20:24,360 --> 00:20:25,240
Shut up.

470
00:20:25,740 --> 00:20:26,420
It's meaningful.

471
00:20:28,080 --> 00:20:30,340
I don't work properly. Is it meaningful to go?

473
00:20:31,680 --> 00:20:32,260
Good night.

474
00:20:52,540 --> 00:20:53,960
Sorry for disturbing.

475
00:20:54,880 --> 00:20:55,160
Sit down.

476
00:20:56,380 --> 00:20:57,000
I'm sorry, on your rest day.

477
00:20:57,700 --> 00:20:59,620
I'm glad you're home.

478
00:21:01,220 --> 00:21:03,020
I have red wine.

479
00:21:03,020 --> 00:21:03,320
What do you want to drink?

480
00:21:04,380 --> 00:21:05,060
Water is ok.

481
00:21:06,100 --> 00:21:07,280
What's wrong?

482
00:21:07,620 --> 00:21:10,280
It's been a long time.

483
00:21:10,280 --> 00:21:11,140
No, seriously.

484
00:21:12,780 --> 00:21:13,640
You're not drunk.

485
00:21:16,680 --> 00:21:18,700
I can't drink.

486
00:21:19,660 --> 00:21:21,220
What do you mean?

487
00:21:21,600 --> 00:21:23,300
I'll drink.

488
00:21:24,360 --> 00:21:25,260
Of course.

489
00:21:27,060 --> 00:21:28,540
Let's toast.

490
00:21:33,680 --> 00:21:35,080
Cheers.

491
00:21:37,180 --> 00:21:37,620
It's been a long time.

492
00:21:38,720 --> 00:21:39,380
Did you make me pregnant?

493
00:21:45,200 --> 00:21:48,920
Because there is a baby in me.

494
00:21:52,140 --> 00:21:53,440
Really?

495
00:21:54,780 --> 00:21:55,480
Yes.

497
00:22:02,080 --> 00:22:04,040
Well...

498
00:22:06,820 --> 00:22:09,560
I found out about it

499
00:22:09,560 --> 00:22:11,080
right after we broke up.

500
00:22:13,760 --> 00:22:15,620
I couldn't tell you.

501
00:22:16,060 --> 00:22:18,160
I wanted to meet you

502
00:22:18,160 --> 00:22:21,100
and talk to you.

503
00:22:21,100 --> 00:22:23,360
It's...

504
00:22:23,360 --> 00:22:24,760
the 13th week.

505
00:22:29,040 --> 00:22:32,300
Are you sure

506
00:22:32,300 --> 00:22:33,220
it's my baby?

507
00:22:37,200 --> 00:22:38,600
Yes.

508
00:22:41,100 --> 00:22:42,620
It's the right timing.

509
00:22:42,620 --> 00:22:43,220
It's the right timing.

510
00:22:50,420 --> 00:22:52,520
Are you...

511
00:22:53,980 --> 00:22:55,240
already dating her?

512
00:22:58,240 --> 00:22:58,940
No.

513
00:23:02,080 --> 00:23:02,800
I see.

514
00:23:04,280 --> 00:23:06,060
I'm sorry.

515
00:23:07,060 --> 00:23:09,260
Why am I here?

516
00:23:09,260 --> 00:23:09,700
Rio.

517
00:23:11,540 --> 00:23:11,820
I'll make sure

518
00:23:11,820 --> 00:23:13,280
not to bother you.

519
00:23:14,160 --> 00:23:14,980
Bother?

520
00:23:15,520 --> 00:23:16,340
I'm sorry.

521
00:23:18,000 --> 00:23:19,080
Bye.

522
00:23:39,260 --> 00:23:42,500
Please see the show's official X for more details.

523
00:23:47,170 --> 00:23:49,520
This is the play I was interested in.

524
00:23:49,740 --> 00:23:50,520
Wait.

525
00:23:51,260 --> 00:23:51,940
You're collecting so much.

526
00:23:52,360 --> 00:23:53,320
That's crazy.

527
00:23:53,880 --> 00:23:54,880
It must have been hard.

528
00:23:55,220 --> 00:23:56,380
No, not at all.

529
00:23:56,540 --> 00:23:57,140
Really?

530
00:23:58,580 --> 00:24:00,380
Do you know about

531
00:24:00,380 --> 00:24:02,420
this kind of play?

532
00:24:02,660 --> 00:24:04,940
When I was little,

533
00:24:04,940 --> 00:24:06,860
my parents took me to a musical.

535
00:24:09,120 --> 00:24:11,100
My parents are divorced.

536
00:24:11,800 --> 00:24:13,960
I'm so jealous.

537
00:24:14,360 --> 00:24:16,260
I'm so jealous.

538
00:24:16,260 --> 00:24:17,360
My mom and dad

539
00:24:17,360 --> 00:24:18,380
are having an affair.

540
00:24:18,440 --> 00:24:19,160
Really?

541
00:24:20,940 --> 00:24:22,080
You're so heavy.

542
00:24:22,940 --> 00:24:25,860
I'm used to it.

543
00:24:25,860 --> 00:24:26,820
I see.

544
00:24:28,420 --> 00:24:30,340
It's not the time to talk about this.

545
00:24:30,800 --> 00:24:31,460
No.

546
00:24:31,460 --> 00:24:33,860
I have to make a decision.

547
00:24:37,740 --> 00:24:39,580
What do you mean?

548
00:24:40,360 --> 00:24:41,780
Do you know

549
00:24:41,780 --> 00:24:43,260
what people in your company say about you?

550
00:24:43,280 --> 00:24:43,920
I don't know.

551
00:24:44,380 --> 00:24:45,520
They say you're the worst.

552
00:24:47,900 --> 00:24:49,340
I don't want to be told

553
00:24:49,340 --> 00:24:49,360
that I cheated on you.

554
00:24:50,100 --> 00:24:51,920
You apologized.

555
00:24:52,380 --> 00:24:54,060
Then why do you repeat the same thing?

556
00:24:55,140 --> 00:24:55,800
If you want to say that,

557
00:24:56,160 --> 00:24:56,940
you have to invest the money.

558
00:24:56,940 --> 00:24:59,900
That's not good.

559
00:25:00,440 --> 00:25:02,380
How many times

560
00:25:02,380 --> 00:25:02,840
do you think you're spending

561
00:25:03,700 --> 00:25:04,960
What do you mean?

562
00:25:05,020 --> 00:25:07,780
I've never been told that.

563
00:25:08,680 --> 00:25:10,180
You've always been like this.

564
00:25:32,560 --> 00:25:34,300
I want to get rid of you for real.

565
00:25:35,220 --> 00:25:37,300
But it costs 500,000 yen.

568
00:26:23,620 --> 00:26:25,020
Ms. Rio?

569
00:26:26,360 --> 00:26:26,880
Yes? 

570
00:26:26,880 --> 00:26:27,380
What's wrong?

571
00:26:27,780 --> 00:26:29,860
I was thinking.

572
00:26:30,660 --> 00:26:31,600
Sorry to keep you waiting.

573
00:26:32,180 --> 00:26:32,960
Let's go.

574
00:26:33,440 --> 00:26:33,880
Yes.

575
00:26:39,380 --> 00:26:42,580
I've been looking for you.

576
00:26:42,580 --> 00:26:44,340
My name is Yamazoi.

577
00:26:44,340 --> 00:26:44,840
Nice to meet you.

578
00:26:45,640 --> 00:26:47,100
Nice to meet you.

579
00:26:47,140 --> 00:26:48,780
Nice to meet you.

580
00:26:48,780 --> 00:26:49,260
It's been a long time.

581
00:26:50,560 --> 00:26:51,440
This year,

582
00:26:52,280 --> 00:26:52,420
I hope to continue

583
00:26:52,420 --> 00:26:53,400
Shitei High School.

584
00:26:56,580 --> 00:26:57,060
Thank you.

585
00:26:57,060 --> 00:27:00,280
Nice to meet you.

586
00:27:01,460 --> 00:27:02,060
Thank you.

587
00:27:02,060 --> 00:27:04,200
The students here are very good.

588
00:27:05,000 --> 00:27:05,960
Thank you very much.

589
00:27:07,000 --> 00:27:08,520
Thank you.

590
00:27:08,580 --> 00:27:09,320
Thank you for your hard work.

591
00:27:10,380 --> 00:27:11,960
I'm so tired.

592
00:27:13,180 --> 00:27:14,060
I'm tired.

593
00:27:14,060 --> 00:27:15,180
It's not enough people.

594
00:27:15,180 --> 00:27:16,640
Even though it's a retail market,

595
00:27:16,880 --> 00:27:17,760
it's still here.

596
00:27:19,060 --> 00:27:20,540
I was in trouble.

597
00:27:20,960 --> 00:27:22,400
I'm the commander of the era.

598
00:27:23,440 --> 00:27:24,020
